From 72f47ba273b0b74a5639fdfe31e33416338159e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:17:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: keep the pool re-place hint under the
 admission census; notices print it after the queue clause

PR #1821 review nits (pullrequestreview-5885001489):
- kanban_queue_position.local_words returned from its admission_pools branch before
  pool_could_run, so kanban_show dropped the re-place hint on hosts with the root
  admission census. The census branch now ends with pool_words(place) when a pool
  worker could start the card (skip framing kept).
- Both chat-wait notices printed the multi-sentence pool hint inside the parenthesised
  queue clause and repeated 'do not run its work outside the dispatcher' before their
  own advice. The hint is now a payload field (pool_hint) printed after the clause,
  via pool_words(place, advice=False); ready_hint does the same.
---
